  "details": "When moving the playspace with something like OVR Advanced Settings, the personal mirror does not move along with the player. While for a world locked personal mirror this behavior seems logical, when using local placement I'd prefer the mirror to move with me when moving my playspace.\nWhen I am, say, adjusting my height with the playspace mover, I often reach out above the mirror I already placed, requiring me to move it up with me after I repositioned myself.",
